   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">TAIHE, CHINA - SEPTEMBER 05: An aerial view shows flooded areas and a section of National Highway 105 covered by floodwater in MashÃ¬ Town, Taihe County, on September 5, 2026 in Taihe, Jiangxi Province of China. Heavy rainfall in recent days has caused rising river levels, leading to flooding in parts of the county and slow traffic on the highway. (Photo by Liu Lixin/China News Service/VCG via Getty Images)</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
